# NOTE: git only reads `#` as a comment at the START of a line. A trailing
# comment is part of the pattern, so `storage/  # media` matches nothing at
# all — which is how the first version of this block ignored none of it.
# Comments therefore go on their own lines here.
storage/
backups/
